<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40401" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιορκ-έω</span></b> , also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφιορκέω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			22.1126.9
		</span></i> (Delph. Amphict.), <i><span class="en">
			<u>OGI</u>
			229.69
		</span></i> (Smyrna, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), etc.: fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.188
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				914
			</span></i>, etc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσομαι </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				D.
				54.40
			</span></i>: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιώρκησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					49.67
				</span></i>
			, inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ορκῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.68
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφ-</span>
			): pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιώρκηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					948e
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				3.1.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Din.
				1.47
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιόρκηκα</span> is v.l.
				in Hdt.l.c.):—<i>swear falsely, forswear
				oneself</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδ᾽</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιορκήσω πρὸς δαίμονος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.188
				</span></i>
			: also, c.acc., of things sworn by, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς
				βασιληΐας ἱστίας ἐπιώρκηκε</span>
			<i>has sworn falsely by</i> the royal hearth, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.68
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Din.
					1.47
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεούς</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1609
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.4.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				49.67
			</span></i>, etc.: mostly abs., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				298
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				428
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Nu.</u>
				402
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				65c
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ἐφρόντιζ᾽ ἐπιορκῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.119
				</span></i>
			: c.acc.cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὅρκους τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					49.65
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.115
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐορκέω</span>, Lexap.<i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.98
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cleanth.Stoic.
				1.131
			</span></i>, Chrysipp.ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.63
			</span></i>, who distinguishes betw. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐορκεῖν</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀληθορκεῖν</span>, and betw. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιορκεῖν</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψευδορκεῖν</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. simply, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμνυμι</span>
			, <i>swear</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				10.17
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
